{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"112687","name":"Catalonia Rigoletto","description":"This hotel is located in the heart of Barcelona's commercial and financial centre. It comprises a total of 65 rooms including 2 single rooms and 4 junior suites. Facilities on offer to guests include a lobby area with a 24-hour reception. Dining options include a café, a bar and a restaurant. There are conference facilities and WLAN Internet access. Guests can also take advantage of the room and laundry services. All rooms come with a private bathroom with a bath or shower and a hairdryer. They also offer a king-size or double bed, a plasma TV and a minibar. Free WLAN Internet access is provided. Furthermore, individually regulated air conditioning and heating are provided in all accommodation as standard. Guests can enjoy Mediterranean cuisine in the elegant dining room. They can select their continental breakfast from a buffet. Only one dog or cat under 20 kg per room is allowed (upon request). Supplement of X night/animal and a pet deposit.","address":"Sabino De Arana, 22-24","city":"BARCELONA","countryCode":"ES","postalCode":"08028","lat":41.386267,"lng":2.125251,"stars":4,"chain":"CATA","giataCode":"183450","phone":"938031000","email":"rigoletto@cataloniahotels.es","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/112687/112687a_hb_a_010_20260226_114606.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/112687/112687a_hb_a_011_20260226_114607.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/112687/112687a_hb_l_001_20260226_114454.jpg","category":"lobby","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/112687/112687a_hb_l_002_20260226_114455.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/11/112687/112687a_hb_w_049.jpg?20240601031539?20250625083636","category":"room","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigg